# Demo capture output (scripts/demo-capture.ts). Videos belong in
# $PLAYROOM_CAPTURE_HOME, outside this tree; these rules exist so a stray run
# inside the repo cannot be committed.
#
# THE README'S STILLS ARE THE ONE EXCEPTION, and they are not videos: a seven-second GIF and one
# frame of beat 5 live in docs/demo/assets/ because a README that describes a refusal without
# showing it is asking to be taken on trust. Full takes stay outside the tree.
videos/
*.webm
